    "detailed_description": "ESCAPE!! is an endless runner through a haunted forest. <br />\r\nJump, slide, kick and close your eyes to survive. <br />\r\nBeautiful handmade pixel art, with frightening monsters and a terrified survivor.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the 5 level Story Mode, Sally Holmes sprints through a terrible forest, trying to find her fam. She must avoid not only the monster chasing her, but also each of the frightening things she encounters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInfinite Mode has Sally running from a monster for as long as she can, everything getting faster and faster.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSiesta Mode gives Sally a chance to relieve all the Tension she's built up running from monsters. She can Sleep, Eat, or Relax in the hot springs.",
